  "project_description": "This module adds description list plugin into your WYSIWYG. It provides dl, dt and dd html tags.\n\n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n CKEditor v4 (not compatible v5)\n\nDescription list plugin : https://github.com/Reinmar/ckeditor-plugin-descriptionlist \n\n Back to top \n\n Installation \n \n Download the plugin from https://github.com/Reinmar/ckeditor-plugin-descriptionlist \n Place the plugin in the root libraries folder (/libraries/ckeditor-plugin-descriptionlist). \n Install/Enable the CKEditor Description List module as you would normally\n\ninstall a contributed Drupal module. \n Configure your WYSIWYG toolbar to include description list buttons. \n Back to top",
